        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "K, I understand where the maintainers are coming from. Wrapping core builtins did feel a bit heavy, but since LuaJIT doesn't support `__name` for native `luaL_typerror` overrides, it was the only path I could find to surface `vim.NIL` directly. \r\n\r\nClosing this out but thanks for taking a look regardless 👋",
